  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Steps toward sustainable forest management with the local communities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to contribute to the use of forests as a means of income diversification for local communities in Ethiopia by improving the sustainable management of these forests in the context of climate change through strengthening capacity for research and education at Mekelle University in Ethiopia in partnership witth the Norwegian University of Life Sciences.</narrative>
  </description>
